+
+| File | What |
+|---|---|
+| `run.py` | the driver: the manifest and the entries it can honour, the toolchain, three build steps, the suites in manifest order, the summary |
+| `manifest.py` | `nitpick.toml` in the compiler's subset, held to the compiler's schema at the pin |
+| `toolchain.py` | the interpreter; `llc`, `opt`, `ld.lld` at the manifest's LLVM; its `datalayout` the one the pinned `opt` derives (`BUILD.md` B-1a) |
+| `expect.py` | the markers a test file carries (B-6, B-6a) |
+| `build.py` | one root to one module, both legs, the undefined-symbol scan (B-2), and `npkc`'s exit alphabet |
