+| `stages.py` | the `program` stage, `compile`/`positive` and `compile`/`negative`: both legs, `stress`, the cap, the exact-code rule |
+| `baseline/` | the floor program, the syscaller and the floor-writer (build step 1, and the cap's control) |
+
