+
+- the manifest names no entry this runner cannot judge; the interpreter is the Python the
+  harness is measured on or later, and the toolchain is the manifest's, exactly;
+- the call-edge scan reads the library's facets and the denied ones apart, on this run, at
+  this compiler — the floor, the syscaller and the floor-writer differ by `npk_sys6` and by
+  `npk_write` alone, the syscaller's edge to the kernel through `sys` is left unflagged and
+  the floor-writer's `main` is flagged, `SAFETY.md` S-2;
+- every module under `src/` compiles as a root with no diagnostic, and none needs a symbol the
+  runtime does not define — or the root's `failsafe` — or calls one its rules deny;
+- `[build] entry` and every conformance root emit byte-identical IR from two copies of the tree,
+  each with its manifest (B-4);
+- every program unit was built at -O0 and through `opt -O2`, its modules stating the
+  manifest's target rows, scanned, linked with `npkrt.o` alone, and run `stress` times on each
+  leg — under its cap after the floor program under the same cap — and exited as it expects;
